+# Claude Code reflection
+
+Resolve `scripts/` relative to this installed skill directory.
+`claude-project-dir.mjs` prints this session's transcripts directory, wherever
+the shell has moved since:
+
+```sh
+dir=$(node "<skill-dir>/scripts/claude-project-dir.mjs") && node "<skill-dir>/scripts/find-transcript.mjs" "$dir" "<opening prompt fragment>"
+```
+
+The finder parses Claude Code JSONL only. If the line exits 1, prepare a digest
+of this conversation instead.
+Never glob across other projects.
+
+Dispatch reviewers and the synthesizer using `Agent`, `subagent_type:
+"general-purpose"`. The tooling and judgment roles default to `opus`
+unless the user supplies an override. Preserve MCP access; the prompts prohibit writes.
+When the `SubagentHandback` tool is present, this run is itself a subagent: start
+the three reviewers in one message and the synthesizer after them, all with
+`run_in_background: false`, so a hand-back never stops them.
